<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chikalata cha Paolo kwa Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chikalata chi che Paolo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Che Tito</para>
  <para style="mt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chi che Tito chili chikalata chimo mwa ikalata ncheche i che Paolo chiŵannembele mundu jumo jumo pamalo pa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito. Ikalata ine itatu ili Timoseo jwaandanda ni Timoseo jwaaŵili ni Filimoni. Che Paolo ŵannembele chikalata cho che Tito, nambo sooni ŵalembile nti chikalata cho chikukomboleka kusyomekwa kwa liloŵe pa ŵandu. Tukukombola kumanyilila chelechi ligongo akulisala nsyene nti nduna, chindu chakuchimanyilila che Tito chitandile kalakala. Che Paolo ŵalembile chikalata chi pa yaka ya 63-65 pakumala kupagwa Che Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Che Paolo akunsalila che Tito kuti ŵalongosye ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito ŵaali mu chilumba cha Kilete. Che Paolo ŵalembile chikalata chi kwa ligongo lya kunsalila che Tito itajile pakwasagula ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito ni kwajiganya, ni indu iŵansalile mu chikalata ikulanda ni yeila yaisasile mu ikalata iŵili iŵalembele che Timoseo. Chikalata chao chikusala yakuti kusachilwa kulongosya kwa chambone nnope ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito. Kwayele ilongola pamo ni mipingo ja ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito ŵa lelo jino akusachilwa atendeje yeleyo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io1">Che Paolo akunsalila che Tito ŵasagule ilongola ŵakwajogopa Akunnungu (1:1-16).</para>
  <para style="io1">Sooni akunsalila ŵajiganye ŵandu kutama yakuti pakusaka Akunnungu (2:1-3:11).</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbesi, che Paolo akumalichisya kwa kulemba maloŵe gampepe gakumalichisya (3:12-15).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Une che Paolo, jundi jwakutumichila jwa Akunnungu ni nduna jwa Che Yesu Kilisito, ngunnembela chikalata chi mwe che Tito. Uneji najichikwe kwalongosya ŵandu ŵasagulikwe ni Akunnungu kuti ŵakulupilile ni kuumanyilila usyenesyene ni kutama yaikuti pakwanonyelesya Akunnungu. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Chikulupi ni umanyilisi wa usyene wu ikutupa chilolelo cha umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Akunnungu ŵangakombola kusala ya unami, ŵatupele chilanga cho chikanaŵe kugumbikwa chilambo. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Ŵaliunukwile liloŵe lyakwe pa katema kakwe. Une napegwilwe utenga wo kwa lilajisyo lya Akunnungu Nkulupusyo jwetu juŵangulupilile kuti naulalichile kwa ŵandu.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Chikalata chi ngunnembela mmwe che Tito, mwanangu jwa usyenesyene jutukukamulangana mu chikulupi chimo. Ngunsachila umbone ni chitendewele kutyochela kwa Akunnungu Atati ni Che Yesu Kilisito nkulupusyo jwetu.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masengo ga che Tito ku Kilete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Nanlesile ku Kilete kuti nkombole kuikolosya yanayose yaisigalile ni kwaŵika achakulu ŵa mipingo ja ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito mu musi wauli wose mpela indite kunnajisya, <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />chilongola jwa mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito akusachilwa kuŵa mundu jwangali magambo gagali gose, ni jwali ni jwankongwe jumo, ni ŵanache ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito ni ŵangaŵechetelwa nkati wende wangalumbana atamuno ungapilikanichisya. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Pakuŵa jwakuujimilila mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito akusachilwa kuŵa mundu jwangali magambo gagali gose, ligongo jwelejo ali jwakwimilila masengo ga Akunnungu. Ngakusachilwa kuŵa mundu jwa chibuli atamuno jwakalipa atamuno jwakolelwa atamuno jwakuputa atamuno kuŵa mundu jwakunonyelwa nnope mbiya. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Nambo ikuŵajilwa aŵe jwakunonyelwa kwapochela achalendo ni jwakunonyelwa ni indu yambone ni jwakulitulusya ni jwakupanganya yaikwanonyelesya Akunnungu ni jwanswela ni jwakukombola kulilongosya nsyene. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Akusachilwa kulikamulisya liloŵe lyakukulupilichika mpela yaitite kujiganyikwa, kuti akombole kwalimbisya mitima ŵandu ŵane kwa majiganyo ga usyene ni kwalosya ileŵo yao ŵandu ŵakugakana majiganyo go.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Pakuŵa kwana ŵandu ŵajinji nnopennope ŵaali mu mpingo wa Ŵayahudi ŵaŵagalawiche ni kunkulupilila Kilisito, ŵele ŵakukanila kupilikana, akuŵecheta wamba ni akwalyungasya ŵandu ŵane. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ŵele ŵandu akanyichikwe kuŵecheta, pakuŵa akwatindiganya ŵandu ŵa majumba gamajinji kwa kwiganya indu yangaŵajilwa kwiganya, akutenda yele kwa nningwa wangalumbana wa kupatila mbiya. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Namose jumo jwa ŵakulondola ŵao achinsyene jwali Mkilete ŵatite, “Ŵakilete ali ŵa unami moŵa gose, ali mpela ijama yakusakala, ŵaulesi ni ŵakunyela.” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Umboni wu uli wausyenesyene. Kwa ligongo lyo, mwajamuche kwa kalipa kuti akole chikulupi chisyene. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Mwajiganye aleche kupilikanila ngano sya unami sya Ŵayahudi namose malajisyo ga ŵandu ŵakuukanila usyene. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Kila chindu chili cheswejele kwa ŵandu ŵaswejele paujo pa Akunnungu, nambo ngapagwa chindu chachili cheswela kwa ŵandu ŵangalumbana ni ŵangakwakulupilila Akunnungu, pakuwa nganisyo syao ni ntima wa kukumbuchila kuitenda indu yambone ijonasiche. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Ŵandu ŵa akwitichisya kuti akwamanyilila Akunnungu, nambo mu ipanganyo yao akwakana. Ŵandu wo ali ŵakuchima ni ŵakutindiganya tindiganya, namose ngakukombola kupanganya masengo gagali gose gambone.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gagali ga usyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Nambo mmwejo njiganye majiganyo ga usyene. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Mwasalile achalume ŵachekulwipe aŵe ŵakukombola kulilongosya achinsyene ni ŵakuchimbichikwa, ni ŵakulitulusya, ni ŵautindimisyo mu chikulupi ni mu unonyelo ni mu upililiu.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Ni achakongwe ŵachekulwipe iyoyo peyo mwasalile atameje mu utame wa kwajogopa Akunnungu. Analambusye atamuno akaŵa achikapolo ŵakukolelwa divai, nambo ŵakwiganya yaili yambone pe, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />kuti ŵajiganye achiŵali kwanonyela achiŵankwawo ni kwanonyela ŵanache ŵao, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />ni ŵakukombola kulilongosya achinsyene ni ŵaswejele, ŵakugagosa yambone majumba gao ni ŵa ntima wambone ni ŵakwapilikanichisya achiŵankwawo kuti Liloŵe lya Akunnungu likasatukanwa ni ŵandu.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Ni iyoyo achachanda mwalimbisye kuti akombole kulilongosya achinsyene. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Mu indu yose mwasyene mme chisyasyo cha kupanganya yambone nchilosyaga usyene ni mmajiganyo genu nlosye kuti mmwe mwasyene nkugakulupilila ni kugakuya. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Maloŵe gankuŵecheta ganaŵe ni chileŵo chachilichose kuti ŵammagongo ŵenu jatende soni, pakuŵa nganakola chachilichose changalumbana chakusala nkati ngani syetu.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Achikapolo ŵapilikanichisye achakulu ŵao ŵa pachilambo ni kwanonyelesya mu yanayose. Alisepusye kwangangana nawo, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />pane kwajiŵa indu yao. Nambo alosye katema kose kuti ali ŵa ntima wambone ni ŵakukulupichika, kuti majiganyo ga Akunnungu Nkulupusyo jwetu galoleche yambone mu yose.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Pakuŵa umbone wa Akunnungu waukwikanawo ukulupusyo kwa ŵandu wose uwunukulikwe. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Nombewo ukutujiganya kuti tuleche chigongomalo ni tama syangalumbana sya pachilambo pano, tutameje kwa kulilongosya achinsyene ni kuŵa ŵambone paujo pa Akunnungu ni kutama kwa kwanonyelesya Akunnungu mu chilambo chino, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />tuchilindililaga lyuŵa lya upile lyatukulilolela, pelepo chiutyochele ukulu wa Akunnungu Ŵakulu ni Nkulupusyo jwetu Che Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Jwelejo ŵalityosisye nsyene kwa liwamba lyetu uwe kuti atuwombole mu ileŵo yose ni kutuswejesya kuti tuŵe ŵakwe asyene, ŵandu ŵaali ni lung'wanu lwakupanganya ipanganyo yambone.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Sambano mwajiganye indu yi kwa ulamusi wose, mwalimbisye mitima ni kwajamuka. Mundu jwalijose anannyosye.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Kutendekanya yaili yambone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Mwakumbusye ŵandu kulitulusya paujo pa ilongola ni ŵakutawala ni ulamusi, ŵapilikanichisye ni kuŵa chile kupanganya ipanganyo yambone. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Mwasalile akasantukana mundu jwalijose, anaŵe ŵaumani, aŵeje ŵambone achilosyaga kulitulusya katema kose kwa ŵandu wose. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Pakuŵa nowe ŵakwe kalakala ko twaliji ŵakuloŵela, ŵakukanila ni ŵakulyungasika. Twaliji achikapolo ŵa tama syangalumbana ni kulinonyelesya kwa pachilambo. Twatemi mu chigongomalo ni kukolelana wiu, ŵandu ŵatuchimile ni uweji twachimile ŵanyawo. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Nambo pawawoneche umbone ni unonyelo wa Akunnungu Nkulupusyo jwetu, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />ŵatukulupwisye uweji, ngaŵa kwa ligongo lya chindu chachilichose chambone chitutesile uwe, nambo kwa ligongo lya chanasa chao. ŵatujosisye sambi syetu ni kwa litala lya Mbumu jwa Akunnungu jwatutesile tupagwe kaaŵili ni kuŵa ni utame wa sambano. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵatujitilile kwa winji Mbumu jwa Akunnungu kwa litala li Che Yesu Kilisito Nkulupusyo jwetu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />kuti kwa umbone wao tukombole kuŵalanjikwa ŵambone ni kuukola umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi utukuulolela. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Liloŵe li lili lya usyene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Ngusaka nsale chindu chi kwakulimbila, kuti ŵandu ŵaŵakulupilile Akunnungu, akumbuchile kulimbila mu ipanganyo yambone. Chelecho chili chambone ni chakwakamuchisya ŵandu. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Nambo nlisepusye ni mausyano ga kuloŵela, ni kugamanya meena ga ngosyo ngano ni kulipulana pamo ni makani gankati Malajisyo, pakuŵa indu yo ngaŵa chindu kwa Akunnungu ni yangalimate. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Mundu jwakwikanawo kulekangana, pakumala kunjamuka kaandanda ni kaaŵili, munnecheje. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Nipele nkumanyilila kuti mundu jwati iyoyo alyungasiche, ni kukola sambi, ni sambi syakwe sikunlamula nsyene.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maloŵe ga kumalichisya ni malajisyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Pachinannajisye che Atema pane che Tukiko kukwenu njanguye kwika ku Nikapoli kukuunola une pakuŵa ngusaka ndame kweleko katema kambepo. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Ntende inkuti pakukombola munkamuchisye che Sena, mundu jwakugamanyilila malajisyo pamo ni che Apolo kuti akombole kuutanda ulendo wao, nipele nnole kuti anasoŵekwe ni chindu chachilichose chakusaka mu ulendo wao. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Ikusachilwa ŵandu ŵetu alijiganye kulimbichila kupanganya masengo gambone, kuti akombole kwakamuchisya ŵandu ŵakusoŵekwa ni indu ya kila lyuŵa ni anatame utame wangaukwapokasya.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Ŵandu wose ŵaali pamo ni une akunkomasya. Mungomachisye mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakutunonyela, ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Umbone wa Akunnungu utame ni ŵanyamwe wose.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>